flowchart TD
  Start([Open Communities]) --> Fetch[Load every listCommunities page]
  Fetch --> Loaded{Directory loaded?}
  Loaded -->|No| Retry[Show retry and keep data unchanged]
  Loaded -->|Yes| Filter[Sort, search, and filter the directory]
  Filter --> Owned[Select records where ownerDid equals viewer DID]
  Owned --> Targets{Owned targets found?}
  Targets -->|No| Fresh([Ready for a new community])
  Targets -->|Yes| Inventory[Show exact count, names, and addresses]
  Inventory --> Confirm{Explicit final confirmation?}
  Confirm -->|No| Keep[Keep every community]
  Confirm -->|Yes| DeleteEach[Delete targets one at a time]
  DeleteEach --> Protocol{Non-public protocol Space exists?}
  Protocol -->|Yes| DeleteSpace[[Delete or tombstone protocol Space]]
  Protocol -->|No| Metadata[[Delete Radlib metadata with cascade]]
  DeleteSpace --> Metadata
  Metadata --> Result{All target deletions succeeded?}
  Result -->|No| Partial[Report deleted and remaining targets; stop]
  Result -->|Yes| Fresh
  Fresh --> End([Start from scratch])
